{"seq":1,"slug":"offline-online-gap","title":"离线-在线指标背离原因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ranking-offline-eval-platform/offline-online-consistency/offline-online-gap","wordCount":3243,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"离线-在线指标背离原因\">离线-在线指标背离原因</h1><p>「离线涨了线上没涨」在搜索团队里被当成一句抱怨讲了很多年，但它其实是一个可分解的现象。把它拆开之后会发现，背离从来不是随机噪声造成的——每一类背离都对应一个具体的、可识别的、多数情况下可预防的机制。把背离当成运气，团队会养成「离线随便看看」的习惯；把背离拆成清单，团队就能在评测集设计阶段、指标选择阶段和实验设计阶段分别堵住相应的漏洞。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>离线指标与在线指标之间的关系可以写成一个分解式。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{off}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是离线指标的变化量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{on}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是真实业务效用的变化量，两者之差由四类误差构成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>分布偏移</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>选择偏差</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>指标不完全</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>反馈回路</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{off} - \\Delta_{on} = \\underbrace{\\delta_{dist}}_{\\text{分布偏移}} + \\underbrace{\\delta_{sel}}_{\\text{选择偏差}} + \\underbrace{\\delta_{metric}}_{\\text{指标不完全}} + \\underbrace{\\delta_{fb}}_{\\text{反馈回路}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vli